      "message": "Yes, I was using cpu_util_cfs() at first in (aosp/1335755), but Qais commented that\n\"cfs utilization could go above SCHED_CAPACITY_SCALE, so you lost the capping part that was done in stune_util()\", so I changed it this way now. Actually I don\u0027t know if it will go above SCHED_CAPACITY_SCALE, maybe we can also add capping in cpu_util_cfs()?",
