      "writtenOn": "2020-06-23T12:52:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah it makes sense. I missed that schedutil_cpu_util() takes max as an arg. I think arch_scale_cpu_capacity() and capacity_orig_of() should be the same.\n\nSo scrapping cpu_util_freq() and replace it with a simple cpu_util_cfs() looks good to me.",
      "parentUuid": "9df8f79e_1e237662",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 335,
        "startChar": 26,
